WEBVTT

00:16.680 --> 00:20.280
Touku o miteru sono manazashi wa

00:20.280 --> 00:23.950
Kokoro no naka no koe o kiiteru

00:23.950 --> 00:28.120
Mada aoi tsuki o dakishimete

00:31.160 --> 00:34.830
Hashiri-tsuzukeru kimi no tsuyosa ga

00:34.830 --> 00:38.470
Mata atarashii tobira o hiraku

00:38.470 --> 00:42.670
Sugu akeru yoru o terashidase

00:45.670 --> 00:53.050
Tatoe hitori de mo kimi
no koto shinjite itai

00:53.050 --> 01:00.290
Sonna shunkan ni kono
sekai wa ugokidasu

01:00.290 --> 01:03.930
Nani o mitsukete yukou

01:03.930 --> 01:07.560
Kokoro o hakidashite

01:07.560 --> 01:14.330
Mata koko de aeru yo
sore ga shinjitsu nara

01:14.700 --> 01:18.410
Nani o mitsumete iyou

01:18.410 --> 01:25.210
Kono te o sashidashite
tsukanda genjitsu o

01:25.210 --> 01:28.880
Let it go shinjiyou

01:31.520 --> 01:34.250
Gojyo, you bastard! You cheated,
didn't you?!

01:34.660 --> 01:38.330
The stupider they are, the more
they try to blame it on others.

01:38.330 --> 01:43.330
How the hell do you get four aces
three times in a row?!

01:43.330 --> 01:44.700
Well?!

01:44.700 --> 01:47.770
Damn cheating, pervy water sprite!

01:47.770 --> 01:49.640
What the hell did you call me,
you bratty monkey?!

01:49.640 --> 01:50.470
Wanna fight?!

01:50.470 --> 01:50.570
If you're gonna fight, get off
first, damn it.
Wanna fight?!

01:50.570 --> 01:51.770
If you're gonna fight, get off
first, damn it.
You want me to beat you up?!

01:51.770 --> 01:52.670
If you're gonna fight, get off
first, damn it.
You bastard!

01:52.670 --> 01:53.780
You bastard!

01:53.780 --> 01:55.410
Oh, is that how it's gonna be?!

01:55.410 --> 01:56.380
Rowdy as always, aren't they?
Oh, is that how it's gonna be?!

01:56.380 --> 01:57.500
Rowdy as always, aren't they?

02:11.090 --> 02:13.230
Man, that's cold!

02:13.230 --> 02:14.700
Hey, Hakuryu!

02:14.700 --> 02:16.290
That's cheap, avoiding getting wet
all by yourself!

02:19.500 --> 02:20.040
I'm gonna drown!

02:20.040 --> 02:20.540
Gojyo, you're a water sprite
and you can't swim?
I'm gonna drown!

02:20.540 --> 02:23.440
Gojyo, you're a water sprite
and you can't swim?

02:25.370 --> 02:28.540
I only swim around in bed.

02:28.540 --> 02:32.950
I see. Go cool your heads
one more time!

02:33.320 --> 02:34.880
I'm gonna drown!

02:34.880 --> 02:36.110
I'm gonna drown!

02:40.460 --> 02:43.420
Oh, I'm sorry.

02:44.030 --> 02:45.930
You all seemed to be
such good friends

02:45.930 --> 02:48.600
and having so much fun, I just
couldn't help myself.

02:48.600 --> 02:51.290
Please don't group me in
with these wretches.

02:51.630 --> 02:54.120
Anyway, why don't you all
come to my place?

02:54.370 --> 02:58.240
I'll serve you some hot tea
for having laughed at you.

03:13.490 --> 03:15.790
Oh, were there enough towels?

03:15.790 --> 03:18.890
Yes, you've been a lifesaver.

03:18.890 --> 03:21.500
Thank you, for letting us
borrow clothes too.

03:21.500 --> 03:25.170
We'd like to thank the person these
clothes belong to as well.

03:25.170 --> 03:28.930
Oh, no. I live with my aunt now.

03:29.370 --> 03:30.370
Now?

03:30.370 --> 03:32.910
All right, enough talk.

03:32.910 --> 03:34.510
Thank you, Auntie Han.

03:34.510 --> 03:37.240
Come and eat before it gets cold.

03:38.080 --> 03:42.180
This looks great! Can we eat this?!

03:42.180 --> 03:44.190
Yes, of course.

03:44.190 --> 03:45.990
Thanks for the food!

03:45.990 --> 03:47.920
Hey, you idiot! Put it on
your plate first!

03:47.920 --> 03:49.790
Oh, right!

03:49.790 --> 03:52.730
Thank you for going so far
as to prepare us a meal.

03:52.730 --> 03:54.900
Oh, Goku, you're spilling.

03:54.900 --> 03:57.200
Bastard, quit serving just yourself!

03:57.200 --> 03:58.690
Don't fight over stupid things like that!

03:59.500 --> 04:01.160
Thank you, everyone.

04:02.400 --> 04:05.340
I'm very grateful to you.

04:05.340 --> 04:09.970
After all, it's been a long time since
I've seen Shunrei smile.

04:10.650 --> 04:15.280
You see, Shunrei had a sweetheart,
and they got along so well together.

04:15.280 --> 04:16.650
Oh, my.

04:16.650 --> 04:18.850
But he was a demon.

04:19.220 --> 04:21.790
About a year ago, a change
came over him,

04:21.790 --> 04:24.430
just like the other demons.

04:24.430 --> 04:30.500
Before he completely lost himself,
he shook off Shunrei and ran away.

04:30.500 --> 04:34.260
I haven't seen her smile
much since then.

04:35.570 --> 04:38.270
She does laundry almost every day,

04:38.270 --> 04:42.110
so everything will be ready if
her sweetheart should come back.

04:42.110 --> 04:46.480
And it's probably also to keep
her mind off the loneliness.

04:46.480 --> 04:49.580
This is no good. She's got
a previous engagement.

04:49.580 --> 04:52.090
I see, so that's why.

04:52.090 --> 04:57.030
Then these clothes belong to him?

04:57.030 --> 05:00.120
Yes, aren't they neatly laundered?

05:00.700 --> 05:03.990
I had no idea we were wearing
such important clothing.

05:05.830 --> 05:07.500
They smell good!

05:08.340 --> 05:12.710
Is it really all right for us to wear
these precious clothes?

05:13.810 --> 05:16.610
It's probably her way
of thanking you,

05:16.610 --> 05:19.450
for giving her something
to smile about for once.

05:19.450 --> 05:22.320
Or maybe it's because you
all are so handsome

05:22.320 --> 05:25.320
that she saw her sweetheart
in you boys,

05:25.320 --> 05:27.260
that sweetheart Jien of hers.

05:27.260 --> 05:28.590
Jien?!

05:28.590 --> 05:30.160
Gojyo, you know him?

05:30.160 --> 05:31.820
Well, who knows?

05:35.130 --> 05:39.460
Hey, Hakkai, is Gojyo
hiding something?

05:41.000 --> 05:43.230
I don't like things like that!

05:43.610 --> 05:45.540
I don't have any secrets or anything.

05:45.540 --> 05:47.800
It's not fair that he does!

05:55.120 --> 05:56.150
Hey...

05:56.150 --> 05:57.220
Yes?

05:57.220 --> 06:00.020
You got a picture or something
of this Jien guy?

06:01.090 --> 06:05.790
Auntie Han told you, didn't she?
But why?

06:05.790 --> 06:10.060
I just want to see what this guy, who
makes a pretty girl cry, looks like.

06:10.530 --> 06:13.430
No, I don't have any pictures.

06:14.240 --> 06:17.330
He was a demon, right?

06:20.080 --> 06:21.600
He was, wasn't he?

06:22.110 --> 06:24.240
Is there something wrong with him
being a demon?

06:26.010 --> 06:30.750
He was a truly kind man. Is there
something wrong with that?

06:30.750 --> 06:32.850
I have faith in him.

06:32.850 --> 06:36.690
That's why, every single day,
I clean this vacant room

06:36.690 --> 06:39.260
and wash clothing that
no one will wear.

06:39.260 --> 06:42.390
This is all that I can do!

06:43.300 --> 06:46.960
Sorry, that wasn't how I meant it.

06:48.800 --> 06:51.100
I'm sorry, I...

06:52.240 --> 06:53.970
I'm the same.

06:54.640 --> 06:57.240
It just so happens, I'm a demon too.

07:01.320 --> 07:05.120
Hey, Hakkai, who's this Jien?

07:05.890 --> 07:09.120
Well, I suppose Gojyo hasn't
asked me to keep it a secret.

07:09.120 --> 07:14.400
If it is him, his name is Sha Jien,
Gojyo's older brother.

07:14.400 --> 07:16.060
A half-brother, to be precise.

07:20.740 --> 07:24.640
I'll have you know, if it was a lie,
I'd lie more convincingly.

07:24.640 --> 07:26.110
I'm a demon too.

07:28.710 --> 07:30.580
Don't you believe me?

07:31.710 --> 07:33.870
Don't you believe me?

07:35.280 --> 07:40.850
No, I believe in him.

07:41.660 --> 07:44.920
That's why I can believe you.

07:45.560 --> 07:46.930
Don't cry.

07:47.700 --> 07:50.220
It's not fair for a nice girl to cry.

07:50.970 --> 07:52.520
Why not?

07:53.770 --> 07:56.200
'Cause it makes me want
to sweet-talk you.

07:56.200 --> 07:57.930
You're weird.

08:01.340 --> 08:02.480
In other words,

08:02.480 --> 08:06.750
Gojyo's mother is human and
Jien's mother is a demon?

08:06.750 --> 08:11.920
Right, so Jien, Gojyo's older brother,
is a full-blooded demon,

08:11.920 --> 08:14.960
because his father was also a demon.

08:14.960 --> 08:17.160
I hear Gojyo suffered a lot of hardship,

08:17.160 --> 08:21.530
because he was a child born between
a human and a demon.

08:21.530 --> 08:22.660
Why?

08:23.530 --> 08:25.930
Because they say a child born
between a human and a demon

08:26.330 --> 08:29.640
will bring about great misfortune.

08:29.640 --> 08:30.760
Really?

08:31.270 --> 08:32.470
Really!

08:33.210 --> 08:35.540
Straight from the horse's mouth,
so there's no doubt about it.

08:36.410 --> 08:37.750
Move it!

08:37.750 --> 08:39.370
Go to sleep, you bastards!

08:49.720 --> 08:52.320
They must have been really tired.

08:57.730 --> 09:00.500
Oh, Shunrei, good morning!

09:00.900 --> 09:03.530
Good morning. Isn't it
a nice day today?

09:03.970 --> 09:05.910
Auntie Han is at the back
of the house.

09:05.910 --> 09:07.070
Got it.

09:09.340 --> 09:10.650
Good morning.

09:10.650 --> 09:14.250
Good morning! What do you
have for me today?

09:14.250 --> 09:17.250
The thing is, I don't have much.

09:17.250 --> 09:21.320
Some people were attacked by
demons in the woods to the west.

09:21.320 --> 09:23.660
Oh, my, how terrible.

09:23.660 --> 09:26.490
And according to someone who
says he saw it happen,

09:26.490 --> 09:31.400
there was a silver-haired one
among the demons.

09:31.400 --> 09:32.660
You don't mean that...

09:38.340 --> 09:41.000
Shunrei! Shunrei!

09:41.680 --> 09:43.140
Wake up!

09:44.380 --> 09:47.050
Breakfast? I'll have some.

09:47.050 --> 09:49.450
This isn't the time for that!
Shunrei has...

09:49.450 --> 09:50.620
What's wrong?

09:50.620 --> 09:53.120
She's gone off into the woods
to the west!

09:53.120 --> 09:54.890
We were talking about how demons

09:54.890 --> 09:57.290
attacked some people in
the woods yesterday,

09:57.290 --> 10:01.200
and she overheard that one of the
demons looked a lot like him.

10:01.200 --> 10:03.000
You mean Jien?

10:03.000 --> 10:06.870
Yes, but we don't even know
if it's true or not.

10:09.140 --> 10:10.910
Jien...

10:10.910 --> 10:12.340
Jien!

10:13.370 --> 10:16.280
"Love is blind," is it?

10:16.280 --> 10:18.250
Please be all right, Shunrei.

10:26.750 --> 10:29.550
Where are you? Where are you, Jien?

10:33.030 --> 10:36.000
Sheesh, what the heck
is Shunrei thinking?!

10:36.560 --> 10:39.270
A brat like you would
never understand!

10:39.270 --> 10:43.170
Now, now, right now our priority
is to find Shunrei!

10:43.170 --> 10:45.040
Exactly!

10:45.040 --> 10:49.240
Since she's probably not thinking
about anything except her beloved.

10:51.650 --> 10:54.720
We've lost her trail.

10:54.720 --> 10:57.850
This forest is deeper
than we'd thought.

10:57.850 --> 10:59.490
What a pain.

10:59.490 --> 11:02.290
Let's split up. Gojyo and Hakkai,
you go that way.

11:02.290 --> 11:03.930
Goku and I will go this way.

11:03.930 --> 11:04.390
All right.

11:04.390 --> 11:04.990
Got it!
All right.

11:04.990 --> 11:05.560
Got it!

11:05.560 --> 11:07.620
Jien, where are you? Jien?

11:08.160 --> 11:12.760
There was a silver-haired one
among the demons.

11:17.840 --> 11:20.030
Where are you, Jien?

11:24.680 --> 11:25.770
Jien?

11:27.750 --> 11:29.550
How does it look, Goku?

11:29.550 --> 11:31.720
I don't smell any blood,

11:31.720 --> 11:34.350
so I think Shunrei's probably still okay.

11:35.360 --> 11:38.660
This is bad. If we don't
find Shunrei soon...

11:39.290 --> 11:41.320
How are things going with
Gojyo and Hakkai?

11:42.030 --> 11:44.960
Shunrei! Shunrei!

11:47.070 --> 11:48.400
Shunrei...

11:50.470 --> 11:53.170
I'm no good at dealing with
women when they cry,

11:54.710 --> 11:57.870
because it reminds me of how my
mom was always crying over me.

12:08.160 --> 12:12.720
The mother who raised me would
always look at me and cry,

12:16.660 --> 12:20.970
probably because she saw a shadow
of the man she loved in me

12:20.970 --> 12:23.700
and the phantom visage of the
other woman who bore me.

12:24.840 --> 12:27.930
That's why, even when
she tried to kill me...

12:32.880 --> 12:34.810
I thought it was okay.

12:41.390 --> 12:44.760
It was okay, if my death would
make Mom stop crying.

12:46.590 --> 12:48.430
But the tears that I saw...

12:49.800 --> 12:51.530
...were not hers.

12:53.200 --> 12:54.500
Bro...

12:58.270 --> 13:00.580
Is something the matter, Gojyo?

13:00.580 --> 13:02.010
Don't touch me!

13:02.610 --> 13:04.130
Oh, dear.

13:04.510 --> 13:09.480
Might you be angry because I told
everyone about your brother?

13:09.480 --> 13:11.420
No, I don't care about that.

13:11.850 --> 13:12.980
All right.

13:13.590 --> 13:16.420
But Goku was sulking about it.

13:16.420 --> 13:18.550
He really hates secrets and the like.

13:19.790 --> 13:24.860
Sheesh! He should just mind
his own business, right?

13:25.570 --> 13:28.640
That kind of talk will
cause some anger.

13:28.640 --> 13:31.170
Aw, Goku's such a brat.

13:31.170 --> 13:34.070
No, I was talking about me.

13:35.080 --> 13:36.910
I'm a brat too.

13:37.650 --> 13:41.600
Damn, you make my cool act look
more bratty than you guys.

13:50.360 --> 13:53.190
All right, you've given us
enough trouble!

13:56.230 --> 13:59.100
You got nowhere to run now.

14:02.540 --> 14:05.060
Come on, let's play, missy.

14:06.440 --> 14:08.000
No!

14:08.840 --> 14:09.940
Shunrei!

14:19.690 --> 14:22.820
Well, bravo!

14:23.190 --> 14:26.720
That was a truly sweet
combination attack.

14:27.960 --> 14:30.100
Shunrei, are you all right?

14:30.100 --> 14:32.130
Yes, but...

14:32.130 --> 14:36.040
What?! What did you bastards
do to her?!

14:36.470 --> 14:41.340
Oh, shut up. Who the hell
are you people anyway?!

14:41.340 --> 14:45.850
Us? Oh, you don't know who we are?

14:45.850 --> 14:48.850
Looks like they weren't
sent by Kougaiji.

14:48.850 --> 14:52.290
You won't be popular with the ladies
if you don't know the fads.

14:52.890 --> 14:54.460
Morons!

14:54.460 --> 14:55.790
What did you say?!

14:55.790 --> 14:57.660
You're all mincemeat!

15:01.130 --> 15:04.470
Getting turned into mincemeat with
the guys doesn't appeal to me.

15:04.470 --> 15:07.000
Come on, let's hurry up
and take care of them!

15:07.000 --> 15:09.300
Wait! Please tell me!

15:09.300 --> 15:14.170
Has anyone seen Jien? He has
silver hair, just like you!

15:14.580 --> 15:16.740
Jien has silver hair?

15:21.320 --> 15:24.520
Shut up already. We don't
know any guy like that.

15:24.520 --> 15:28.960
Besides, I'm about the only
silver-haired demon around here.

15:30.220 --> 15:32.990
Jien isn't here...

15:36.000 --> 15:36.760
Shunrei!

15:36.760 --> 15:36.960
Are you okay, Shunrei?!
Shunrei!

15:36.960 --> 15:38.800
Are you okay, Shunrei?!

15:38.800 --> 15:41.770
She's fine. It probably just got
to be too much for her.

15:41.770 --> 15:43.170
It's not surprising.

15:43.170 --> 15:46.740
Man, I've had enough.
Let's go back, everyone.

15:46.740 --> 15:48.680
After all, her aunt must be worried.

15:48.680 --> 15:50.410
You think she'll have lunch
waiting for us?

15:50.410 --> 15:51.350
Stop right there!

15:51.350 --> 15:51.650
Show a little restraint!
Stop right there!

15:51.650 --> 15:52.480
Show a little restraint!
Don't think you can just
ignore us, you bastards!

15:52.480 --> 15:53.950
Don't think you can just
ignore us, you bastards!

15:53.950 --> 15:55.650
Especially you, the guy
with the red hair!

15:55.650 --> 15:57.020
You piss me off!

15:57.650 --> 16:02.490
You know, I've heard that a kid born
between a human and a demon

16:02.490 --> 16:05.320
has red hair and red eyes.

16:11.470 --> 16:12.990
You listening to me?!

16:14.770 --> 16:17.340
I bet the hair down there
is all red too!

16:17.340 --> 16:18.810
Why don't you show us?

16:20.710 --> 16:23.240
You'd better not say
any more than that.

16:23.240 --> 16:24.980
Even if Gojyo doesn't do anything...

16:24.980 --> 16:26.780
We won't let you get away with it!

16:29.550 --> 16:32.350
Really, you guys are a weird bunch.

16:38.790 --> 16:41.020
Mr. Gojyo, you know...

16:41.960 --> 16:43.600
I hope things go back soon

16:43.600 --> 16:46.290
to when humans and demons
got along together.

16:46.930 --> 16:48.060
If...

16:48.900 --> 16:51.710
Because if Jien and I
ever have a child,

16:51.710 --> 16:53.400
I'd want him to be happy.

16:54.740 --> 16:57.710
Damn it! You're not gonna
just get away with that!

16:57.710 --> 17:00.510
We're gonna butcher you, just like
we did those humans yesterday!

17:00.510 --> 17:02.480
You killed people?

17:02.480 --> 17:04.120
Shut up! Get 'em!

17:04.120 --> 17:05.280
Yeah!

17:07.220 --> 17:10.880
What? You really wanna see
the red stuff that bad?

17:18.130 --> 17:19.430
Sorry,

17:22.100 --> 17:24.830
but I only show it to pretty girls.

17:32.250 --> 17:33.510
Auntie...

17:34.180 --> 17:36.450
Oh, you're awake, Shunrei.

17:37.150 --> 17:43.090
Those men saved me in
the woods, and then...

17:43.990 --> 17:47.330
Auntie, where are they?! Where
are Mr. Gojyo and the others?!

17:47.330 --> 17:50.800
Well, the thing is, they left
a long time ago.

17:50.800 --> 17:54.200
I tried to get them to stay
until you woke up, but...

17:55.540 --> 17:56.830
No...

17:57.270 --> 18:00.210
I didn't even thank them.

18:00.910 --> 18:04.500
I wonder how far those boys
have gotten?

18:06.250 --> 18:10.950
Those boys said they're headed
west, just like the setting sun.

18:11.750 --> 18:16.710
The boy with the pretty red eyes
like the sunset said

18:17.490 --> 18:20.520
that they're on a journey to make
the world the way it used to be.

18:21.000 --> 18:25.500
So, Shunrei, Jien will come back
to you someday.

18:25.500 --> 18:27.330
He asked me to tell you that.

18:27.700 --> 18:28.790
Oh, I can't believe myself.

18:29.070 --> 18:30.470
What's wrong, Shunrei?

18:31.040 --> 18:33.530
Mr. Gojyo told me...

18:35.310 --> 18:37.640
Nice girls shouldn't cry.

18:40.780 --> 18:45.620
So basically, the guy Shunrei likes
turned out not to be your brother.

18:45.620 --> 18:49.020
Yeah, Bro doesn't have silver hair.

18:49.920 --> 18:52.120
But man, it's just too bad.

18:53.360 --> 18:54.520
What is?

18:55.100 --> 18:58.290
Nice girls always have a sweetheart.

18:58.930 --> 19:02.130
Then what about nice guys?

19:03.640 --> 19:05.970
They journey through the
wilderness, heading west.

19:07.840 --> 19:09.830
All right, that's one cushion for you!

19:23.620 --> 19:30.050
My wish is a trifling thing.
Isn't that right?

19:32.800 --> 19:34.270
The world?

19:36.770 --> 19:42.370
I don't care what happens to that.
It's such a small thing.

19:46.710 --> 19:50.990
Oh, my beloved, Gyumaoh!

19:50.990 --> 19:54.960
All I care about is reviving you!

19:54.960 --> 19:58.450
Once I do, the entire world
will become mine.

19:59.490 --> 20:04.730
I won't allow anyone to get
in my way, not even the gods!

20:04.730 --> 20:07.270
You understand that,
don't you, Kougaiji?

20:07.270 --> 20:09.500
As you say, Gyokumen Koushu.

20:10.910 --> 20:15.140
Oh, you're allowed to call me
Mother, you know?

20:15.140 --> 20:17.910
You are Gyumaoh's son, after all.

20:17.910 --> 20:22.150
Of course, your real mother
is sealed within that pillar,

20:22.150 --> 20:26.490
unable to even speak of
her love for him now.

20:26.490 --> 20:27.580
Damn it!

20:28.760 --> 20:30.220
Mother,

20:30.220 --> 20:36.030
someday, I will free you from that
accursed woman's binding spell!

20:36.860 --> 20:42.630
And to do that, I am ready to fight
anyone and everyone!

20:44.100 --> 20:50.130
Sou hito ga yosasou na
kao de yatte kuru

20:50.510 --> 20:55.640
Totsuzen na higeki mo
utagau koto wa naku

20:56.080 --> 21:01.360
Nagekigoto sezu damatta mama de

21:01.360 --> 21:04.660
Ue o miagerunda

21:04.660 --> 21:10.660
Donna arifureta shiin
mo enji-tsuzukeru

21:10.660 --> 21:16.000
Yume toka kibou toka iu mae ni sa

21:16.000 --> 21:21.440
Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou

21:21.440 --> 21:25.400
You must fight against yourself

21:32.320 --> 21:35.960
The sun sets and a new day comes

21:35.960 --> 21:38.160
Repeating is one change

21:38.160 --> 21:42.200
Don't avert eyes from differences

21:42.200 --> 21:46.130
Your nerve and soul to the limit

21:46.130 --> 21:48.970
Go forward now

21:48.970 --> 21:53.940
Haritsumeta puresshaa tonariawase de

21:53.940 --> 21:59.380
Dare yori mo daitan futeki ni warau

21:59.380 --> 22:04.850
Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou

22:04.850 --> 22:08.910
You must fight against yourself

22:18.770 --> 22:20.200
Next Saiyuki

22:21.100 --> 22:25.440
I've never even thought about fighting
for someone else's sake.

22:25.440 --> 22:28.880
But this girl says she'll
fight for Kougaiji.

22:29.340 --> 22:31.950
I don't think she stands
a chance against us,

22:31.950 --> 22:34.310
no matter how hard she tries,
but she's just so earnest.

22:34.310 --> 22:37.510
Come on, if you're going to fight,
just fight for your own sake.

22:38.120 --> 22:38.190
Next Gensou Maden Saiyuki:
"A Beautiful Assassin"

22:38.190 --> 22:42.860
Next Time
A Beautiful Assassin
Next Gensou Maden Saiyuki:
"A Beautiful Assassin"

22:42.860 --> 22:44.320
You'd do well to watch!
